1. LFM3-1.7B (Liquid AI, Inc.)

The LFM3-TS model weights are a Derivative Work of LFM3-1.7B by Liquid AI, Inc.
(https://huggingface.co/LiquidAI/LFM3-1.7B), which is licensed under the LFM Open License v1.0.

NOTICE OF CHANGES. The weights of LFM3-1.7B were modified by Nardi Xhepi:

  - the weights of the language model were fine-tuned on time-series question answering, except the token
    embedding matrix (shared with the output layer), which is unchanged;
  - a time-series encoder (`model.ts_tower`) and a projector (`model.multi_modal_projector`) were added; these
    weights are new and are not part of LFM3-1.7B;
  - the tokenizer gained the name `<|ts|>` for a previously unused token id (125033), and the chat template gained
    a `timeseries` content part.

The distribution of LFM3-1.7B this work started from contains no NOTICE file.


